" colspan="1">3.6 (1.0&#x02013;13.4)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.5 (1.3&#x02013;15.6)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.9 (0.8&#x02013;10.5)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn6-ehp0115-001442"><p>CI, confidence interval.</p></fn><fn id="tfn7-ehp0115-001442"><label>a</label><p>All ORs were adjusted for sex, age category, BMI category, and lifetime smoking status; in addition, wet-weight values were adjusted for estimated total lipid concentration.</p></fn><fn id="tfn8-ehp0115-001442"><label>b</label><p>Other analytes included serum concentrations of DDE, HCB, and mirex for total PCBs, PCB-153, and PCB-74; total PCBs, DDE, and HCB for mirex; total PCBs, mirex, and HCB for DDE; and total PCBs, mirex, and DDE for HCB.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>